  "full-article-text": "<p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\"><em id=\"\">This article refers to a special epoch that occurred in July and August 2021. It is no longer relevant and retained only for historical purposes.</em></strong></p><p id=\"\">The period following the genesis of the <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-the-radix-public-network-and-radix-ledger\"><strong id=\"\">Radix</strong> <strong id=\"\">Public</strong> <strong id=\"\">Network</strong></a> on July 28th 2021 was a special “bootstrapping” <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/whats-an-epoch-2\"><strong id=\"\">epoch</strong></a> lasting at least 14 days.&nbsp;</p><p id=\"\">There was no rush to start swapping <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-the-xrd-and-exrd-tokens\"><strong id=\"\">eXRD</strong></a> for <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-the-xrd-and-exrd-tokens\"><strong id=\"\">XRD</strong></a>, <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-to-stake-and-unstake-xrd-in-the-desktop-wallet\"><strong id=\"\">staking</strong></a>, connecting nodes, or <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/can-i-move-stake-freely-between-validators-or-do-i-have-to-unstake-and-restake\"><strong id=\"\">registering</strong> <strong id=\"\">validators</strong></a> during this bootstrapping epoch. During this period, everyone was equally “first in line” when the bootstrapping epoch ended and normal epochs (of approximately 30-90 minutes) began.&nbsp;</p><p id=\"\">The bootstrapping epoch allowed XRD <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-token\"><strong id=\"\">token</strong></a> holders and node-runners time to <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-should-i-choose-validators-to-stake-to-2\"><strong id=\"\">choose which validators</strong></a> to delegate to, and set up their validator nodes, respectively.</p><p id=\"\">For a full breakdown of how this period worked, please see the blog article <a id=\"\" href=\"https://www.radixdlt.com/post/radix-mainnet-launch-timeline\"><strong id=\"\">Radix Mainnet Launch Timeline</strong></a>.</p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Further reading:</strong></p><ul id=\"\"><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://www.radixdlt.com/post/radix-mainnet-launch-timeline\"><strong id=\"\">Radix Mainnet Launch Timeline</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-should-i-choose-validators-to-stake-to-2\"><strong id=\"\">How should I choose validators to stake to?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-being-delivered-for-the-olympia-mainnet\"><strong id=\"\">What is being delivered for the Olympia Mainnet?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-can-i-do-on-the-olympia-mainnet\"><strong id=\"\">What can I do on the Olympia mainnet?</strong></a></li></ul>",
